From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:19:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: Use the common and laptop SMC
 sensors

The J604 hwmon node listed only the four power keys that had readings
on 1.606, CPU Die Hottest (TCMz) and the fan, so the battery, charger,
storage and Wi-Fi temperatures and the input and battery voltages that
the other Apple laptops report were missing.

The J604's own SMC key list (debugfs macsmc-hwmon/keys on 1.608, 2808
keys) has every key of hwmon-common.dtsi and hwmon-laptop.dtsi as a
readable 4-byte float: PSTR, PDTR, PMVR, PHPC, TH0x, TB0T, TCHP, TW0P,
VD0R, SBAV and ID0R. The temperatures read 22.1 C (TB0T) to 26.9 C
(TW0P) at idle on AC. Include the two files, as t8112-j413 does, and
drop the four power nodes they now provide with the same labels.

TCMz stays the first temperature channel; the included temperatures
follow it, and no thermal zone refers to these channels. Ib8f (the
J713's display supply current) is also in the J604 list, but its meaning
on this machine is not measured, so it is not added here.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts | 37 +++++++-----------------
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
index 1e99778645..0a6435dc28 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
@@ -173,35 +173,9 @@
 	smc_hwmon: hwmon {
 		compatible = "apple,smc-hwmon";
 
-		/*
-		 * The four power keys macsmc-power's log_power reads, which
-		 * read on this machine (1.606, on AC: PDTR 7.9 W,
-		 * PSTR 7.9 W, PMVR 3.4 W, PHPC 1.5 W). Labels as in
-		 * hwmon-common.dtsi and hwmon-laptop.dtsi.
-		 */
-		power-PDTR {
-			apple,key-id = "PDTR";
-			label = "AC Input Power";
-		};
-
-		power-PHPC {
-			apple,key-id = "PHPC";
-			label = "Heatpipe Power";
-		};
-
-		power-PMVR {
-			apple,key-id = "PMVR";
-			label = "3.8 V Rail Power";
-		};
-
-		power-PSTR {
-			apple,key-id = "PSTR";
-			label = "Total System Power";
-		};
-
 		/*
 		 * On this machine TCMz read the same as the hottest P-core die
-		 * sensor under macOS.
+		 * sensor under macOS. It stays the first temperature channel.
 		 */
 		temperature-TCMz {
 			apple,key-id = "TCMz"; /* DTV-THERM-1 */
@@ -210,6 +184,15 @@
 	};
 };
 
+/*
+ * Every key of hwmon-common.dtsi and hwmon-laptop.dtsi is in this machine's
+ * SMC key list (debugfs macsmc-hwmon/keys on 1.608, 2808 keys): PSTR, PDTR,
+ * PMVR, PHPC (power), TH0x, TB0T, TCHP, TW0P (4-byte float temperatures,
+ * 22.1-26.9 C at idle), VD0R, SBAV (voltage) and ID0R (current), all
+ * readable 4-byte floats.
+ */
+#include "hwmon-common.dtsi"
+#include "hwmon-laptop.dtsi"
 #include "hwmon-fan.dtsi" /* DTV-THERM-2 */
 
 &nub_spmi {
